      {
       "tag": "td",
       "attrs": [],
       "html": "This parameter is used to • Query the current cancellation status by calling cancellation_ handler.IsCanceled(). Returns true in case, the current conversation has been cancelled and false otherwise. • Register a notifier function by calling cancellation_handler.Set Notifier(). The registered notifier is called if the current conversation is cancelled."
