       "tag": "td",
       "attrs": [],
       "html": "Returns a Future, which either gets readied to ReadSharedOutput (transferResponseParameterRecord for a positive response message) or readied with ErrorCode from DiagUdsNrcErrc (for an negative response message). Data in ReleaseSharedHandler.responseData will be placed after the blockSequenceCounter as transferResponseParameterRecord in the positive response."
